{"id":70,"flavor":[{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!"],"text":"When hungry, it swallows anything that moves. Its hapless prey is dissolved by strong acids."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Weepinbell has a large hook on its rear end. At night, the Pokémon hooks on to a tree branch and goes to sleep. If it moves around in its sleep, it may wake up to find itself on the ground."},{"games":["Y","LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"It spits out Poison Powder to immobilize the enemy and then finishes it with a spray of Acid."},{"games":["X","FireRed"],"text":"The leafy parts act as cutters for slashing foes. It spits a fluid that dissolves everything."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"A Pokémon that appears to be a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"If its prey is bigger than its mouth, it slices up the victim with sharp leaves, then eats every morsel."},{"games":["HeartGold"],"text":"Even though it is filled with acid, it does not melt because it also oozes a protective fluid."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"At night, a WEEPINBELL hangs on to a tree branch with its hooked rear and sleeps. If it moves around in its sleep, it may wake up to find itself on the ground."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"When it's hungry, it swings its razor-sharp leaves, slicing up any unlucky object nearby for food."},{"games":["Gold"],"text":"Even though it is filled with ACID, it does not melt because it also oozes a neutralizing fluid."},{"games":["Yellow"],"text":"When hungry, it swallows anything that moves. Its hapless prey is melted inside by strong acids."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Chlorophyll","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in harsh sunlight."},{"name":"Gluttony","hidden":true,"description":"If the Pokémon is holding a Berry to be eaten when its HP is low, it will instead eat the Berry when its HP drops to half or less."}],"eggGroups":["Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"forest","color":"Green","shape":"Blob","evolution":{"id":69,"name":"Bellsprout","condition":null,"children":[{"id":70,"name":"Weepinbell","condition":"Lv. 21","children":[{"id":71,"name":"Victreebel","condition":"Use Leaf Stone","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,22],[1,35],[1,74],[13,79],[15,77],[17,78],[24,51],[29,282],[32,230],[39,380],[44,75],[47,398],[54,21],[58,438]],"machine":[491,34,450,331,227,203,412,263,202,447,803,580,282,437,141,679,345,398,884,182,115,156,402,214,188,482,76,164,241,129,14,851,168,92,885,474,311],"egg":[499,275,668,389,235,321,388],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-5","name":"Erika's Weepinbell","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"5","artist":"LINNE","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-5/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-5/large"},{"id":"sv3pt5-70","name":"Weepinbell","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Common","number":"70","artist":"Jerky","img":"sv3pt5/70"},{"id":"swsh5-2","name":"Weepinbell","set":"Battle Styles","date":"2021-03-19","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"2","artist":"Shibuzoh.","img":"swsh5/2"},{"id":"sm10-14","name":"Weepinbell","set":"Unbroken Bonds","date":"2019-05-03","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"14","artist":"otumami","img":"sm10/14"},{"id":"sm7-2","name":"Weepinbell","set":"Celestial Storm","date":"2018-08-03","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"2","artist":"Miki Tanaka","img":"sm7/2"},{"id":"sm2-2","name":"Weepinbell","set":"Guardians Rising","date":"2017-05-05","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"2","artist":"Mina Nakai","img":"sm2/2"},{"id":"xy3-2","name":"Weepinbell","set":"Furious Fists","date":"2014-08-13","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"2","artist":"Mizue","img":"xy3/2"},{"id":"hgss4-53","name":"Weepinbell","set":"HS—Triumphant","date":"2010-11-03","rarity":"Unco